<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9112"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 9:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Let us recall one Mr. Valadez, whose <i><b>CODE VIOLATIONS</b></i> were the excuse used to ruin his freaking life early last December...and let us note that the current suspect&#39;s job entailed, among other things, <i><b>&#34;CODE ENFORCEMENT.&#34;</b></i>  <BR> <BR>I&#39;m just sayin&#39;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
