<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9123"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hbtcontrol<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hbtcontrol<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 10:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I guess since we are probably going to speculate about things for a quite awhile before we are given facts by WPD, perhaps Mr. Valadez was &#39;set-up&#39; by BTK to remove suspicion from himself?  Our POI, or I guess it&#39;s now safe to say, Rader, might have made enough acquaintenances within the LE community to pull that off. Possible? <BR> <BR>Thank God he&#39;s finally caught.  The rest of the horror is still to come for the victims&#39; families yet again, as well as his own as this plays out in court. <BR> <BR>I guess I just want to know why????  Sorry, Tom, for an off-topic post.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
